c$ acts as a proportionality factor and is assumed to be identical for all individual glaciers within the study area [15]. To obtain an accurate estimate of total glacier volume, Eq. (1) was applied to each glacier polygon individually. The resulting volumes were summed to yield the total glacier volume of the study area.
